 1	# B2 Frozen Simulation Specification
 2	
 3	Status: Approved
 4	
 5	This is SIMULATION data. Authorizations apply only inside its isolated fixture.
 6	
 7	### B2-001: Required behavior
 8	
 9	Preserve the existing parseTimeout(raw) export in configuration.mjs, default 5000 milliseconds when raw is undefined, and CLI output {timeoutMs,format:'json'}.
10	
11	### B2-002: Required behavior
12	
13	Expand accepted TIMEOUT_SECONDS from ASCII decimal integer strings 1..10 to 1..60 inclusive, including leading zeroes; return seconds multiplied by 1000.
14	
15	### B2-003: Required behavior
16	
17	Reject zero, values above 60, fractions, signs, surrounding whitespace, empty and nonnumeric input through the existing INVALID_TIMEOUT error. The CLI exits 2 with empty stdout and INVALID_TIMEOUT on stderr.
18	
